    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32196" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ-κλύζω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύσω</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			M.Ant.
			8.51
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash out,
				wash away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν βαφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					430a
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ῥύπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Vit.Auct.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			 :—in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Loc. Hom.</u>
				13
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὰ λύματα εἰς τὸν Τίβεριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					5.3.8
				</span></i>
			 ; restored in ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.7
			</span></i> ; <i>to be washed ashore,</i>
			
