					Plu.
					<u>Sull.</u>
					36
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				141
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>stream out,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				1.6.3
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έβλυσεν</span>).</div>
